      <activity id="a4e09a2c-fa0f-56f6-84ed-cd694a6e0a9c" activityNameId="78385d93-8ba1-5866-91e4-80c496f7d13e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Anodising, aluminium sheet</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Anodising, aluminium sheet
Colourless anodising is inventoried. The coating thickness is 20 um.;
Synonyms: Anodisieren; 
UUID: 82eaafaf-cf02-3075-b837-503fc75c9dae
Mechanical surface treatment (50% of the workpieces), degreasing, pickling, anodising (20 um layer thickness) and sealing. Waste water treatment is included. Dying is not included.
Location: Swiss waste treatment assumed
Technology: Porous anodising
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature / survey 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_82eaafaf-cf02-3075-b837-503fc75c9dae.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
